  "source_code": "# cook your dish here\r\nimport sys\r\ninput = sys . stdin.readline\r\nMOD=998244353\r\nN=200000\r\ninv=[0]*(N+1)\r\nh=[0]*(N+1)\r\ninv[1]=1\r\nfor i in range(2,N+1):\r\n    inv[i]=MOD - (MOD//i)* inv[MOD%i]%MOD\r\nfor i in range(1,N+1):\r\n    h[i]=(h[i-1]+inv[i])%MOD\r\nfor i in range(int(input())):\r\n    n=int(input())\r\n    a=list(map(int,input().split()))\r\n    ans=0 \r\n    for i ,x in enumerate(a):\r\n        ans += x*(h[i]+h[n-1-i])\r\n    print(ans%MOD)",
